        'MYP 3 (Grade 8) Mathematics — Term 1 Summative Assessment (Version B)',
        'Term 1 summative assessment, Version B: rational and irrational numbers, standard form, indices, Pythagoras'' theorem, congruence and similarity, trigonometric ratios. 45 questions (Part A 25 objective · 30 marks, Part B 20 theory · 70 marks), 100 marks. Criteria: A 32, B 20, C 24, D 24.',
